# Food for Thought (windurst 14): the egg before the order, with Kerutoto and Ohbiru done (GM vars): kenapaProg 0 (< 3)
# draws randomInt(1, 100): <= 50 is 331, else 330 (120). Kenapa's finish then completes the quest (+120 gil, fame +20,
# Fast Food Deliverer, vars cleared, mustZone). The draw is not stored; `#early_kenapa_rng` takes the other side.
lists WindurstWaters/Kenapa-Keppa/onTrade WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/330 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/331
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=24.0,-5.38,-197.7
quest Windurst.FoodForThought accepted
charvar Quest[2][14]kerutotoProg 2
charvar Quest[2][14]ohbiruProg 3
item HardBoiledEgg
login
trade Kenapa-Keppa HardBoiledEgg x1     # kenapaProg 0 (< 3): randomInt(1, 100): 331 or 330 (120)
finish                                  # the egg taken, +120 gil; the other two done: completed, mustZone
